  `tools/tb peek tb277 ntp1021 u2 115200` · `tools/tb template tb277`
- `tools/tb probe tb277 --consoles u2 --no-prompt --pdu 10.36.230.212 --outlet u2=1
  --name u2=swi_d --read-only --baud 115200 --template ~/claude/device-testing/tb277/x960/ntp-2026-10-21T1159/tb277-u2.setup
  --out /tmp/ntp1021/bench-state-open.md`
- `tools/tb ckcon tb277 ntp1021 u2 115200 "<reads>"` (with `CKTO=120`/`180`)
- `tools/tb cfg tb277 ntp1021 u2 115200 "configure terminal" "<config>" "end" "<reads>"`
- `tools/tb qmark tb277 ntp1021 u2 115200 --mode "configure terminal" -- "ntp <prefix> "`
- `tools/tb ckreload tb277 ntp1021 u2 115200 240`
- `tools/tb capture tb277 ntp1021 eth3|eth4 <secs> <name>.pcap udp port 123`
- `tools/tb ping tb277 eth3 10.38.22.34 3` · `tools/tb ping tb277 eth4 10.38.22.66 3`
- **`tools/ntpc.py`** (NEW): `tools/tb tool tb277 ntp1021 ntpc <server> --bind <src> --count N
  --gap S --timeout S`
- **`tools/ntpwire.py`** (NEW): `tools/tb tool tb277 ntp1021 ntpwire /tmp/ntp1021/<f>.pcap
  [--quiet]`
