VERDICT: PASS -- the x960-56YSQ serves IPv4 NTP exactly as TPS row 260 claims, proven on the wire (mode-4 replies at the configured stratum with the origin timestamp echoed, nothing at all before configuration or after removal, and a per-client `ntp restrict` denial that discriminates between two clients of the same server in the same minute), and the saved configuration survived a cold boot and was serving 13 s after the login prompt with nothing typed into the device.
